{"versions":[{"path":"versions/27ce7703-eb3f-4ef6-a452-a39604afa94c/ad6a5196ea756b3cd56b2d4c90904a1b40ebd135fddc0087c4642185e62aafc7.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"27ce7703-eb3f-4ef6-a452-a39604afa94c","revision":"sha256:ad6a5196ea756b3cd56b2d4c90904a1b40ebd135fddc0087c4642185e62aafc7","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"The right path of a skew heap can be arbitrarily long."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"3e14bd5d-4621-48b9-89b8-506b7deb2b2b"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"382cbfd6-0bca-47f5-b8a6-dd9bd03d51b2"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"斜堆的右路径最坏可随节点数线性增长"}]}}},{"path":"versions/df6a225a-21e2-4144-a0c1-b32e015829c0/471d1c16aceb9c5d9a6c6aa8b82df4b3ef9d49c73ddec50e25b683e3565395c4.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"df6a225a-21e2-4144-a0c1-b32e015829c0","revision":"sha256:471d1c16aceb9c5d9a6c6aa8b82df4b3ef9d49c73ddec50e25b683e3565395c4","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Merge the two leftist heaps in the following figure. Which one of the following statements is FALSE?"},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/aa33d1c5626012d0ca87afdcc06624c9881fdaf0b419fc8ae84a21bbe762d61c.jpg","alt":"题图"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"2 is the root with 11 being its right child","correct":false,"option_id":"9c5c1259-635b-49ea-8f40-86a429c9173e"},{"type":"text","content":"the depths of 9 and 12 are the same","correct":false,"option_id":"f6becfaa-cbe9-4c5b-8ce2-5493a0076a05"},{"type":"text","content":"21 is the deepest node with 11 being its parent","correct":false,"option_id":"0850a694-6751-41bd-9f76-261e4707c53d"},{"type":"text","content":"the null path length of 4 is less than that of 2","correct":true,"option_id":"80710164-be45-421d-afc0-c3e8a0ffda30"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"按图合并后 $Npl(4)=Npl(2)=2$, 因此 D 所称的严格小于不成立"}]}}},{"path":"versions/a8c94343-c467-4b8e-86bb-74d3e5651017/4ea303f011088a647785460d31b56f179d1d37914ff607df1746c5a036327729.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"a8c94343-c467-4b8e-86bb-74d3e5651017","revision":"sha256:4ea303f011088a647785460d31b56f179d1d37914ff607df1746c5a036327729","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Insert keys 1 to 15 in order into an initially empty skew heap. Which one of the following statements is FALSE?"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"the resulting tree is a complete binary tree","correct":false,"option_id":"9d590aca-e36b-44f8-ab48-8ada45b4c01e"},{"type":"text","content":"there are 6 leaf nodes","correct":true,"option_id":"c13ca17d-bebc-49b2-9b67-4078b262a1e1"},{"type":"text","content":"6 is the left child of 2","correct":false,"option_id":"45b9ec5f-3b8d-48c7-9265-c8801c292798"},{"type":"text","content":"11 is the right child of 7","correct":false,"option_id":"4e4e292c-0cf4-4b68-a2e4-e106d878a5be"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"递增插入 1 至 15 后得到 4 层完美二叉树, 共有 8 个叶结点"}]}}},{"path":"versions/abffa103-94f7-4fbf-949b-c2815dca10da/1c36b40b60b057132401b97c974403730b4d93e6038d9c8a3414985c9a4ebd78.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"abffa103-94f7-4fbf-949b-c2815dca10da","revision":"sha256:1c36b40b60b057132401b97c974403730b4d93e6038d9c8a3414985c9a4ebd78","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Merge the two skew heaps in the following figure. Which one of the following statements is FALSE?"},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/27085e800da1e49fd5cee6f1457740f6c06e114fe35d0e63294a524eebe2fc75.jpg","alt":"题图"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"15 is the right child of 8","correct":true,"option_id":"5ed7f3a5-4197-4116-ac80-d7f9873be464"},{"type":"text","content":"14 is the right child of 6","correct":false,"option_id":"f8f46798-1e5e-4c08-93f2-f59c3c47a301"},{"type":"text","content":"1 is the root","correct":false,"option_id":"90435d0c-6aef-4fa7-8a98-b95a548034c6"},{"type":"text","content":"9 is the right child of 3","correct":false,"option_id":"2c9f67c1-af39-4ef6-ba4e-e2ac82817b5f"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"按课件的右路径合并和交换规则, 15 是 8 的左孩子。其他递归实现对剩余路径的交换处理可能不同"}]}}},{"path":"versions/7fd22edd-6f8a-49d9-b839-4fa000a977ca/b347d955db0786ed8a53719c1b36cdbd0d4dee88f499f6b3cecc20cd5575b8d8.json","value":{"schema_version":3,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"7fd22edd-6f8a-49d9-b839-4fa000a977ca","revision":"sha256:b347d955db0786ed8a53719c1b36cdbd0d4dee88f499f6b3cecc20cd5575b8d8","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Merge two leftist heaps\nThe function is to merge two leftist heaps H1 and H2."},{"type":"code","content":"PriorityQueue Merge( PriorityQueue H1, PriorityQueue H2 )\n{ \n  if (H1==NULL) return H2;\n  if (H2==NULL) return H1;\n  if (____(1)____)\n    swap(H1, H2);  //swap H1 and H2\n  if ( H1->Left == NULL )\n    ____(2)____;                   ;\n  else {\n    H1->Right = Merge( H1->Right, H2 );\n    if ( H1->Left->Npl < H1->Right->Npl )\n      SwapChildren( H1 );  //swap the left child and right child of H1\n    ____(3)____ ;\n  }\n  return H1;\n}\n","language":"c"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"(1) `H1->Element > H2->Element`\n(2) `H1->Left = H2`\n(3) `H1->Npl = H1->Right->Npl + 1`"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"先让 H1 指向较小根, 合并右子树后按左式性质交换孩子, 再更新零路径长。原题第 2 空后有两个分号, 原样编译会使 else 前多出空语句"}],"response":{"fields":[{"id":"blank1","label":"第 1 空","kind":"text","blank":"____(1)____"},{"id":"blank2","label":"第 2 空","kind":"text","blank":"____(2)____"},{"id":"blank3","label":"第 3 空","kind":"text","blank":"____(3)____"}]}}}}]}